oratory, 1955 Fremont Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83415, United States"}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Tang, Yalei", "given_name": "Yalei", "family_name": "Tang"}, "role": {"id": "contactperson", "title": {"de": "Kontaktperson", "en": "Contact person"}}, "affiliations": [{"name": "Idaho National Laboratory, 1955 Fremont Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83415, United States"}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "E. Rittenhouse, Joshua", "given_name": "Joshua", "family_name": "E. Rittenhouse"}, "role": {"id": "contactperson", "title": {"de": "Kontaktperson", "en": "Contact person"}}, "affiliations": [{"name": "Idaho National Laboratory, 1955 Fremont Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83415, United States"}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Vakanski, Aleksandar", "given_name": "Aleksandar", "family_name": "Vakanski"}, "role": {"id": "contactperson", "title": {"de": "Kontaktperson", "en": "Contact person"}}, "affiliations": [{"name": "University of Idaho, Department of Nuclear Engineering and Industrial Management, Idaho Falls, ID 83402, United States"}]}, {"person_or_org": {"type": "personal", "name": "Song, Rongjie", "given_name": "Rongjie", "family_name": "Song"}, "role": {"id": "contactperson", "title": {"de": "Kontaktperson", "en": "Contact person"}}, "affiliations": [{"name": "Idaho National Laboratory, 1955 Fremont Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83415, United States"}]}], "languages": [{"id": "eng", "title": {"en": "English"}}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/avakanski/Charpy-Impact-Test-Dataset/tree/main", "scheme": "url", "relation_type": {"id": "issupplementto", "title": {"en": "Is supplement to"}}, "resource_type": {"id": "other", "title": {"de": "Sonstige", "en": "Other"}}}], "sizes": ["778762"], "formats": ["text/markdown", "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"], "rights": [{"id": "cc-by-4.0", "title": {"en": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International"}, "description": {"en": "The Creative Commons Attribution license allows re-distribution and re-use of a licensed work on the condition that the creator is appropriately credited."}, "icon": "cc-by-icon", "props": {"url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode", "scheme": "spdx"}}], "description": "The dataset contains records of Charpy V-notch impact tests of nuclear structural materials. The focus is on studying the influence of specimen dimensions and geometry on Charpy impact test properties. The dataset was created through an extensive literature review of scientific articles. The extracted data points from the literature review are organized into a tabular format database containing 4,775 test records with 55 parameters, including material type and composition, manufacturing information, irradiation conditions, specimen size and dimensions, and Charpy properties. Materials science experts conducted systematic validation checks to ensure the accuracy of the information related to material type, manufacturing processes, treatment methods, chemical composition, testing conditions, as well as other pertinent information."}, "custom_fields": {"mc_references": [{"ref_resource_type": "website", "ref_citation": "I. Lee, J. W. Merickel, Y. Kasala, F. Xu, Y. Tang, J. Rittenhouse, A. Vakanski, R. Song, Charpy Impact Test Dataset of Nuclear Reactor Pressure Vessel Steels.", "ref_link": {"ref_scheme": "url", "ref_identifier": "https://github.com/avakanski/Charpy-Impact-Test-Dataset/tree/main"}}]}, "access": {"record": "public", "files": "public", "embargo": {"active": false, "reason": null}, "status": "open"}, "files": {"enabled": true, "order": [], "count": 2, "total_bytes": 778762, "entries": {"files_description.md": {"id": "c40ac61e-eee8-461d-bebf-c70aa7afc4f5", "checksum": "md5:78e8d2c3d2c3333c52822ceea34033a4", "ext": "md", "size": 192, "mimetype": "application/octet-stream", "storage_class": "L", "key": "files_description.md", "metadata": {}, "access": {"hidden": false}, "links": {"se